“We don’t ask for their permission.”
In an article published by Medium on Saturday, Burners-Lee mentioned that “Mission is to provide commercial energy and an ecosystem in order to help protect the integrity and quality of a new web created on a “Solid” basis”.
Burners-Lee transformed the internet by establishing a Global Web Consortium at the Massachusetts Institute of Technology.
In recent months, Burner-Lee has had an influential opinion in discussions about the neutrality of the network.
Even after Inurupt launched, Burner-Lee will remain the founder and director of the Global Web Consortium, the Global Web Foundation and the Open Data Institute.
"I'm truly optimistic about this new web era," Burner-Lee added.
